 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
Recommends:
 seznamds,
Description: MCP server for the Czech ISDS Data Box system (datovka)
 An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server exposing the Czech ISDS
 ("Datove schranky" / Data Box) system as tools for an LLM agent,
 built on fastmcp and python3-datovka.
 .
 Tools cover listing received/sent messages, fetching a full message
 with its attachments, marking a message as read, sending a new
 message with attachments (or composing one from plain text as a
 PDF), looking up a recipient's data box ID, and a session health
 check. Login credentials are read once from the environment at
 startup and are never tool parameters.
 .
 The seznamds package (recommended) provides an offline directory of
 Czech data boxes for fast recipient lookups; without it, lookups
 fall back to the live, rate-limited ISDS search API.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-datovka
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.1),
 mcp-server-datovka (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Datovka MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-datovka. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-datovka binary as an available MCP server in the
 local mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
